{"title":"Adventures to Architecture: Ride Your Bike to Significant Buildings","link":"https://theradavist.com/adventures-to-architecture-ride-your-bike-to-significant-buildings","date":1795014928000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/4db6e3da9e10e610d5eb5511d6f6a16c6e30879519153a339692bddefa52d5cd.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/b3de39f3fe527d1d692505d5fb3abf1861fe37ced0560e3da93400e87db39428.jpg 640w, /media/4db6e3da9e10e610d5eb5511d6f6a16c6e30879519153a339692bddefa52d5cd.jpg 1800w, /media/684e12ef7a7d2904f8fdbe6409ecd42b0a7884ea77300b9f7c0f0c1621f5ac92.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em>We’re big architecture nerds over here, and riding your bike to see buildings of significance is a real treat. To assist with this, <a href=\"https://adventurestoarchitecture.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Adventures to Architecture</a> is here to help…</em><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/d30f96c70c002b6147333322a95da012b0fb54352e3864fac8f0990052c3edef.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/c61427318f3e88c490c6360a91cf49f2364c59bede25d44beaa27bf5d01de221.jpg 800w, /media/d30f96c70c002b6147333322a95da012b0fb54352e3864fac8f0990052c3edef.jpg 1600w, /media/0471a3448b5ccc3237d15bd99e4c620ee650bd78bd9fa7fb74093e0fac1fa268.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/a44e103797e4099b3bf2700dacf25827515825090656fcf25f7eafd79bb7fb85.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/16dcab2e7d0162ee5e7d63bbd4e13dcd82bbf44428125b1a4c7c14b18060fc2c.jpg 800w, /media/a44e103797e4099b3bf2700dacf25827515825090656fcf25f7eafd79bb7fb85.jpg 1600w, /media/e3f5018e136e7ce6dc2b3fa33230c9e1e4ccb719239bff78b3de9c36032a96a1.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/94dd64354b3221248c414d9ce8504aa2031cc079005c9495232f1a9ff1a79244.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/f41312839088a7e1dc69d93a5a98b66e15d88ce660a7927f9ce76839b86c1ac0.jpg 800w, /media/94dd64354b3221248c414d9ce8504aa2031cc079005c9495232f1a9ff1a79244.jpg 1600w, /media/c9e6f2a3564a25499ef1bbba66fc98684fa5aa7e834b69e3b414f0b35cfcc2af.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Adventures to Architecture lists buildings of significance throughout Europe, offering coordinates and GPS routes to the buildings.</p>\n<p>Each building has links to the project’s details, and a large Google Maps array allows you to plan out a trip dedicated to visiting and studying these buildings.</p>\n<p>Roll on over to <a href=\"https://adventurestoarchitecture.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Adventures to Architecture</a> to see more and check them out on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/adventures2architecture/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a>.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/adventures-to-architecture-ride-your-bike-to-significant-buildings\">Adventures to Architecture: Ride Your Bike to Significant Buildings</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"John Watson","comments":"https://theradavist.com/adventures-to-architecture-ride-your-bike-to-significant-buildings#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"f4a33435f698ea2362f64cd2bb390131c3fa88baf41e5ea84a804e384106a3b9","category":"Cycling"}